<v Sarah Koenig>It's This American Life, I'm Sarah Koenig, sitting in for Ira Glass. We've borrowed today's show from a Chinese saying-- no coincidence, no story. We first aired the show four years ago after asking you to send us your coincidence stories. And you flooded us with more than 1,300 pitches. We found trends, we found gems, we found stories impossible to classify.
