<v Sarah Koenig>Our program was produced today by Brian Reed and me, with Alex Blumberg, Ben Calhoun, Miki Meek, Jonathan Menjivar, Lisa Pollak, Robyn Semien, Alissa Shipp, and Nancy Updike. Senior producer for this episode was Julie Snyder. Our technical director is Matt Tierney. Production help from Emmanuel Dzotsi and Diane Wu. Seth Lind is our operations director. Emily Condon's our production manager. Elise Bergerson's our administrative assistant. Music help from Damian Graef and Rob Geddis.
<v Sarah Koenig>我们的节目今天由布莱恩·里德和我制作，亚历克斯·布隆伯格、本·卡尔霍恩、三木·米克、乔纳森·门吉瓦尔、丽莎·波拉克、罗宾·塞米恩、阿丽莎·希普和南希·厄普代克参与。本集的高级制片人是朱莉·斯奈德。我们的技术总监是马特·蒂尔尼。制作协助来自伊曼纽尔·佐齐和黛安·吴。塞斯·林德是我们的运营总监。艾米丽·康登是我们的制作经理。埃莉斯·伯格森是我们的行政助理。音乐协助来自达米安·格拉夫和罗布·盖迪斯。

00:56:53.630 --> 00:57:20.500
<v Sarah Koenig>[ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS]
<v Sarah Koenig>[鸣谢]

00:57:20.500 --> 00:57:38.630
<v Sarah Koenig>Our original music about the immaculate dollar was written and performed by Bry Webb and Rich Burnett, produced by Bry and Jeff McMurrich. His website, brywebb.com. Our website is thisamericanlife.org, where, this week, we have extra coincidence stories from you that all involve your photographs. That's at thisamericanlife.org.
<v Sarah Koenig>我们关于无暇之美元的原创音乐由布莱·韦伯和里奇·伯内特创作并演奏，由布莱和杰夫·麦克默里奇制作。他的网站，brywebb.com。我们的网站是thisamericanlife.org，本周我们在网站上提供了你们额外投稿的巧合故事，都涉及你们的照片。地址是thisamericanlife.org。

00:57:38.630 --> 00:57:46.920
<v Sarah Koenig>Thanks also to Torey Malatia, who's on vacation with Ira this week. They were so excited for their cruise, but it seems like by day three, the fun is starting to fade.
<v Sarah Koenig>也感谢托里·马拉蒂亚，他本周和艾拉一起休假。他们对游轮非常兴奋，但看起来到第三天，快乐开始消退了。

00:57:46.920 --> 00:57:51.980
<v Juliana Bontrager>You are impossible to argue with. So when you ask, you are so set in you ways.
<v Juliana Bontrager>你真是让人无法辩驳。所以当你询问时，你太固执己见。

00:57:51.980 --> 00:57:54.320
<v Elaine Olson>I'm 81. OK. Yeah, OK.
<v Elaine Olson>我81岁了。好吧。是的，好吧。

00:57:54.320 --> 00:57:59.320
<v Sarah Koenig>I'm Sarah Koenig. Ira Glass will be back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Sarah Koenig>我是莎拉·凯尼格。艾拉·格拉斯下周将带着更多《美国生活》的故事回归。
